We come outside the club.
Kiran, Sara, and Vishnu are with me.
They talk to me.
Sara looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, can you come again next week?" Sara asks.
I like these new friends very much.
"Certainly, I can come," I reply.
"That is very good," Vishnu says.
They become very happy.
"See you next Thursday," Kiran says.
We say goodbye.
I go home happily.
On Thursdays at half past five in the evening, I usually go to the gym.
But now there is a change.
I am going to play badminton on Thursdays from now on.
This is my new routine.
